        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVFAV19ENTR, Keyed Fifth Avenue Knob with Matching Fifth Avenue Tall Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Single Cylinder Fifth Avenue Tall Plate Entryset basks in the old world charm of old Manhattan. The style is at once traditional and contemporary for a keyed front door knobset that straddles the line between both decor themes while still looking elegant. The Keyed Fifth Avenue Knob with Matching Fifth Avenue Tall Plate is available in a wide array of finish options. It is easy to install and will fit most standard pre-drilled doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/fifth-avenue-tall-plate-grandeur-favfav19\"><b>Fifth Avenue Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Fifth Avenue Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate Keyed Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Fifth Avenue Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVFAV19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262395\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVFAV19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
